      "message": "This is causing a change of visibility of some structure (probably from decl-only to full definition).\n\nThe most common case is the inclusion of tracing information via trace_hooks/vendor_hooks.h. Try adding this above the inclusion of security.h:\n```\n#include \u003cLinux/android_kabi.h\u003e\nANDROID_KABI_DECLONLY(trace_eval_map);\n```\n\nIf that doesn\u0027t solve the CRC issue, please follow the steps to isolate the CRC issue in the [\"Resolve CRC mismatches\" documentation](https://source.android.com/docs/core/architecture/kernel/abi-monitor#fixing-crc-mismatch)",
